    "title_en": "Limit of Spin Squeezing in Finite Temperature Bose-Einstein Condensates",
    "abstract_en": "We show that, at finite temperature, the maximum spin squeezing achievable using interactions in Bose-Einstein condensates has a finite limit when the atom number $N\\to \\infty$ at fixed density and interaction strength. We calculate the limit of the squeezing parameter for a spatially homogeneous system and show that it is bounded from above by the initial non-condensed fraction.",
